    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The easiest Google Maps integration for your WordPress website &#8211; No Google API required, copy and paste this sample shortcode anywhere you want your Google maps displayed:</p>\n<pre><code>[quick-maps]Orlando, Florida[/quick-maps]\n[quick-maps]One Infinite Loop, Cupertino, CA 95014[/quick-maps]\n[quick-maps height=\"500px\"]Magic Kingdom, Florida[/quick-maps]\n</code></pre>\n<h4>Premium Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Color Schemes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Lazy Loading</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Custom Markers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Custom JS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Custom CSS</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Requirements</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>WordPress 5.3 or higher</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<p>For more information, see <a href=\"https://quickmaps.io/category/releases/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Releases</a>.</p>\n<h4>1.02.25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixes Feb, 20225</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.16</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Corrected bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Various improvements</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "The easiest Google Maps integration for your Wordpress website [quick-maps]Orlando, Florida[/quick-maps] - No Google API required.",
    "description": "<p>The easiest Google Maps integration for your WordPress website &#8211; No Google API required, copy and paste this sample shortcode anywhere you want your Google maps displayed:</p>\n<pre><code>[quick-maps]Orlando, Florida[/quick-maps]\n[quick-maps]One Infinite Loop, Cupertino, CA 95014[/quick-maps]\n[quick-maps height=\"500px\"]Magic Kingdom, Florida[/quick-maps]\n</code></pre>\n<h4>Premium Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Color Schemes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Lazy Loading</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Custom Markers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Custom JS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://quickmaps.io\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support for Custom CSS</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Requirements</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>WordPress 5.3 or higher</li>\n</ol>\n",
